<atten4>
<list1 type="unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>Touching the temperature sensor may affect the reading due to body heat, so hold the connector side when inspecting the sensor.</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Allow the sensor to adjust to the ambient temperature before inspecting.</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
